# PAGE Editor 0.3.0 native portrait demonstration
join Jane (idle) left [animation="Fade In" length="0.2" wait="true"]
join Antonio right
Jane: I am highlighted while speaking.
Antonio: Now it is my turn.
update Jane (close) center [mirrored="true" z_index="3" fade="Fade Cross" fade_length="0.2" move_time="0.3" move_ease="out" move_trans="cubic"]
Jane: My alternate portrait has its own scale and offset.
update Jane [animation="Bounce" length="0.25" repeat="2" wait="true"]
Jane (idle): An explicit text portrait switches back.
leave --All-- [animation="Fade Out" length="0.2" wait="true"]
join Layered center [extra_data="set Badges/Gold"]
Layered: Gold badge selected.
update Layered [extra_data="set Badges/Blue" mirrored="true"]
Layered: Blue badge selected and mirrored.
update Layered [extra_data="hide Badges"]
Layered: The badge group is hidden.
leave --All--
Finished.
